==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|счита́ть|-ся}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|счита́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-считаться.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|счита́ться|impf|pf=посчита́ться}}

# to settle accounts (with), to consider, to take into consideration, to reckon (with)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''счита́ться''' [[с]] [[удобство|удо́бствами]]|await convenience, suit convenience}}
# {{lb|ru|impersonal|imperfective only}} to be considered / reputed (someone), to be, to pass (for)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''счита́ться''' [[правильный|пра́вильным]]|to be accepted as correct}}
# {{infl of|ru|счита́ть||pass}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|1a|счита́ться}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|счита́ть}}

